{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c414507c-249b-4e1a-a09b-31285bcc03af","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A vector has both size and direction. Start with vector a: three units to the right.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Vector addition: tip to tail"},{"op":"diagram","id":"vectors","region":"right","primitives":[{"kind":"line","points":[[0.15,0.75],[0.65,0.75]],"stroke":"solid","arrow":true,"label":"a = 3 right"},{"kind":"point","at":[0.15,0.75],"label":"start"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c414507c-249b-4e1a-a09b-31285bcc03af","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Place vector b's tail at vector a's tip. Here, b points two units upward.","ops":[{"op":"arrow","id":"vectorb","canvas_id":"vectors","from":[0.65,0.75],"to":[0.65,0.3],"stroke":"solid","label":"b = 2 up"},{"op":"equation","id":"components","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\vec a=(3,0),\\quad \\vec b=(0,2)"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c414507c-249b-4e1a-a09b-31285bcc03af","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The sum connects the original start to the final tip. It represents the same overall displacement as taking both moves.","ops":[{"op":"arrow","id":"resultant","canvas_id":"vectors","from":[0.15,0.75],"to":[0.65,0.3],"stroke":"solid","label":"a + b"},{"op":"equation","id":"sum","anchor":{"el":"components","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\vec a+\\vec b=(3+0,0+2)=(3,2)"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Which direction does the resultant point?","expected_gist":"Diagonally upward and to the right, from the original start to the final tip."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c414507c-249b-4e1a-a09b-31285bcc03af","step":{"id":"s4","script":"Add matching components to find the sum. Its length is square root thirteen, not five, because these vectors point in different directions.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"magnitude","anchor":{"el":"sum","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|\\vec a+\\vec b|=\\sqrt{3^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{13}\\approx3.61"},{"op":"text","id":"rule","anchor":{"el":"magnitude","side":"below","gap":0.1},"content":"Add components, not lengths."}],"checkpoint":null}}
